        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: 33rd Street station, Herald Square, Manhattan, New York City\n- Systems: PATH\n- Lines: Hoboken–33rd Street, Journal Square–33rd Street, Journal Square–33rd Street (via Hoboken)\n- Topics: station location, train service, operating schedule\n\nFacts:\n- 33rd Street station is located at the intersection of 32nd Street and Sixth Avenue in the Herald Square neighborhood of Manhattan, New York City.\n- On weekdays, 33rd Street station is served by the Hoboken–33rd Street line and the Journal Square–33rd Street line.\n- On weekends, 33rd Street station is served by the Journal Square–33rd Street line via Hoboken.\n- PATH trains run 24 hours a day, 7 days a week.",
